  characterName: Nehanda Mbizi
  promptText: "Corporate GMO seeds have introgressed into local fields. Burning contaminated
    seed halts genetic spread but sacrifices this year\u2019s harvest; retaining
    the crop feeds people now but risks future seed sovereignty and crop resilience."
  leftAnswer: Prioritizing seed integrity now protects future harvests and control.
  rightAnswer: Feeding the community this season may be the humane choice today.
